      "snippet": {
        "line": 464,
        "text": "def average (I : Window) (hε : 0 < ε) : AxisSpace I ε →L[ℝ] AxisSpace I ε := linearLift I hε (averageData I hε), with averageData the row data (fun n => 1 / ((n : ℝ) + 1)) id 0, i.e. (A_X F)_n = F_n / (n + 1)"
